      "intended_behavior": "Modify sync_agent to maintain a cached reference to the previously synchronized _internal_state of the agent. Before calling update_agent(), check if agent.state._is_dirty() returns True or if the current internal state differs from the cached internal state. Only then proceed with update_agent. After a successful update, clear the dirty flag and update the cached internal state snapshot. If the update fails, preserve the dirty flag. This optimization reduces unnecessary update calls while preserving existing session management behavior."
    }
